{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CO","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"哥林多後書","commonName":"哥林多後書","title":"哥林多後書","order":47,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"a604231fbbea35edac5846ad421a3341b06e5df55de9ee83d42c78413669680e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CO/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":257},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["新約的執事"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我們豈是又舉薦自己嗎？豈像別人用人的薦信給你們或用你們的薦信給人嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你們就是我們的薦信，寫在我們的心裏，被眾人所知道所念誦的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["你們明顯是基督的信，藉着我們修成的。不是用墨寫的，乃是用永生上帝的靈寫的；不是寫在石版上，乃是寫在心版上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我們因基督，所以在上帝面前才有這樣的信心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["並不是我們憑自己能承擔甚麼事；我們所能承擔的，乃是出於上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他叫我們能承當這新約的執事，不是憑着字句，乃是憑着精意；因為那字句是叫人死，精意",{"noteId":2},"是叫人活。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["那用字刻在石頭上屬死的職事尚且有榮光，甚至以色列人因摩西面上的榮光，不能定睛看他的臉；這榮光原是漸漸退去的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["何況那屬靈的職事豈不更有榮光嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["若是定罪的職事有榮光，那稱義的職事榮光就越發大了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["那從前有榮光的，因這極大的榮光就算不得有榮光了；"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["若那廢掉的有榮光，這長存的就更有榮光了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我們既有這樣的盼望，就大膽講說，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["不像摩西將帕子蒙在臉上，叫以色列人不能定睛看到那將廢者的結局。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["但他們的心地剛硬，直到今日誦讀舊約的時候，這帕子還沒有揭去。這帕子在基督裏已經廢去了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["然而直到今日，每逢誦讀摩西書的時候，帕子還在他們心上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["但他們的心幾時歸向主，帕子就幾時除去了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["主就是那靈；主的靈在哪裏，那裏就得以自由。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["我們眾人既然敞着臉得以看見主的榮光，好像從鏡子裏返照，就變成主的形狀，榮上加榮，如同從主的靈變成的。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：聖靈","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CO/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CO/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CO/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}